    "title": "What Florida restaurants, grocery stores are open and closed on Easter",
    "text": "April 3, 2026, 10:21 a.m. ETEaster Sunday is this weekend and whether you need to get in some last minute shopping or you want a break from cooking, there are plenty of grocery stores, restaurants and fast food places open for Florida residents.Some stores may have reduced hours because of the holiday. Check your nearest location's hours before you head to the store.Here's what is open and closed in Florida on Easter Sunday.When is Easter 2026?Easter Sunday is on April 5.Is Publix open on Easter 2026?No. Publix locations in Florida and other states will not be open on Easter Sunday.Publix stores are closed only three days throughout the year: Thanksgiving, Christmas, and Easter. Will Publix liquor stores or pharmacies be open on Easter 2026?No, Publix liquor stores and pharmacies will also be closed.What grocery stores are open on Easter 2026?Many stores in Florida close for Easter every year, but a few remain open:Whole FoodsSproutsWinn-DixieTrader Joe'sBJ's WholesaleWalmartWhat restaurants are open on Easter 2026?Many national chain restaurants will still be open across Florida. For smaller chain restaurants or local hot spots, it is recommended to call ahead to confirm their hours on Sunday.Applebee'sBob EvansBonefish GrillBoston MarketBuffalo Wild WingsBuca Di BeppoCarrabba's Italian GrillCheddar's Scratch KitchenChili'sCracker BarrelDenny'sGolden CorralFleming's Prime Steakhouse & Wine BarFogo de ChaoHootersIHOPLonghorn SteakhouseOlive GardenOutback SteakhousePerkins Restaurant & BakeryP.F. Chang’sRed LobsterRed RobinRomano's Macaroni GrillRuby TuesdaysRuth's Chris's SteakhouseSeasons 52STK SteakhouseTexas RoadhouseThe Cheesecake FactoryThe Capital GrilleWaffle HouseYard HouseWhat fast food, quick-service places are open on Easter 2026?Many national chain restaurants will still be open across Florida. For smaller chain restaurants or local hot spots, it is recommended to call ahead to confirm their hours on Sunday.Burger FiBurger KingDairy QueenDomino's PizzaDunkin DonutsHardee'sJersey Mike'sJimmy John'sKFCLittle CaesarsMcDonald'sMoe'sPanda ExpressPanera BreadPapa JohnsPopeyesSonicStarbucksSteak N' ShakeSubwayTaco BellWawaWendy'sWhat places are closed on Easter 2026?Arby'sCAVAChick-fil-A (always closed on Sundays)Chicken Salad Chick (always closed on Sundays)ChipotleCulver'sFirehouse SubsMission BBQRaising Cane'sZaxby'sOlivia Franklin is TCPalm’s trending reporter. You can contact her at olivia.franklin@tcpalm.com, 317-627-8048 or follow her on X @Livvvvv_5.",
